  "body_html": "<p></p><h4><strong>Bottom of the Barrel:</strong></h4><p>A stock with price action trending below the 200 day moving average, cannot hit an all time high or a 52 week high. Maybe these reverse…maybe not. But we never fight trends, nor do we need to get the “bottom” price. Out of the 38 stocks, these 6 were eliminated. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg\" width=\"960\" height=\"406\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:406,&quot;width&quot;:960,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;AST SpaceMobile's Next Launches Could Decide Whether Its Rally Regains Orbit&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"AST SpaceMobile's Next Launches Could Decide Whether Its Rally Regains Orbit\" title=\"AST SpaceMobile's Next Launches Could Decide Whether Its Rally Regains Orbit\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Sbj8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8cc85a2-d2fe-4442-902f-aa157237db3b_960x406.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Special note: I keep seeing AST Spacemobile, ASTS, keep popping up in the comments section on TikTok. It still does not meet my personal buying criteria, but the local formation does look like a reversal pattern forming. I’d say to keep an eye on this one, add it to your watchlist. Any price action above $81, would certainly warrant a reconsideration. </p><p>Eliminated: <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$ASTS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$AVAV&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$CRDO&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$MNRO&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$MP&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$XYL&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> $gmg </p><div><hr></div><h4>Too Young</h4><p>SK Hynix, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SKHY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  had its IPO on 09 July 2026. I never touch IPO stocks… but do actively monitor them. This is how I found Palantir in 2024, 3 years AFTER its IPO, before it had its more than 1,100% run. You do not need to be first… if this is a good company, SKHY will show us bullish price structures. But I have a personal rule of never touching IPO stocks for at least 2 years. I have no predictions for SK Hynix, today.</p><p>Sidenote: I have on my “to-do” list, to review all of the IPO stocks from 2023 &amp; 2024, to see if any are showing Palantir structures. Be on the lookout for that. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div><hr></div><p>Before we continue… please remember I am trying to find the best ticker, with the highest probability odds, to run the most… <em><strong>NOW</strong></em>. </p><p>Maybe I ranked your favorite stock a little lower. That does not mean it is a loser stock or will go down. It just means I found tickers that are showing higher probabilities of a larger run. If you would like to talk to me about any of these stocks, or my reasoning, you can swing into the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/eb3f00e6-9f30-4570-8e48-c0bde66e4eec\">Main Chat</a>, and I can elaborate more. </p><div><hr></div><h4>Weakest Trends</h4><p>In this next elimination, I am seeking to get rid of the weakest trends, measured by Relative Strength. <a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/script/D62aWpQ5-Tim-s-Pump-Machine/\">My personally built indicator</a> has a feature that measures the asset’s performance against the S&amp;P 500. Normally, stocks with the strongest, already developed trends, perform the best in major run ups. </p><p>Here is an example, with InnovAge Holding, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$INNV&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. Looks great locally on the chart… but what was it doing in 2023? 2024? 2025? Nothing. In fact, making lower lows. This may change in time, and it may even continue going up…</p><p>But this is not a high probability setup for a huge win, <em><strong>NOW</strong></em>. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FWy6!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa324f4a4-695d-482e-92ab-87c5a162d4d3_1402x816.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FWy6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa324f4a4-695d-482e-92ab-87c5a162d4d3_1402x816.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FWy6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa324f4a4-695d-482e-92ab-87c5a162d4d3_1402x816.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image