div><h4>Weakest Fundamentals</h4><p>If you want a good chance of having a huge run up, its far more favorable to have stocks that are having huge earnings. Nearly all of the stocks remaining, have decent fundamentals: EPS climbing and revenue climbing. With the exception to <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NBIS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>, though it has the highest revenue growth. </p><p>Even one of my favorite stocks, relative to this list, Valero Energy, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$VLO&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  which has ran more than 27% since being included in the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-etf-20?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF 2.0</a>, is being eliminated. Simply because there are other stocks that have stronger fundamentals, and I am looking for the best, <em><strong>TODAY.</strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBM3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4d74063e-2906-44b7-92a8-1821d34e50bc_1403x856.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBM3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4d74063e-2906-44b7-92a8-1821d34e50bc_1403x856.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBM3!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4d74063e-2906-44b7-92a8-1821d34e50bc_1403x856.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sBM3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.c